ItemDisplay[(whm OR bsd OR lsd OR clm OR gis OR bsw OR tri OR vou OR hbw OR cbw OR mxb OR 9sr) NMAG !INF SOCK=0 ILVL>25]: %NAME%{%NAME%%WHITE%1-4, }%CONTINUE%
//varies 3/4/5
ItemDisplay[(fla OR flb OR brn OR scy OR pax OR 9s8 OR 9pa OR lbw OR 8lb OR sbb OR swb OR am1 OR am2 OR am6 OR rxb OR 9ls) NMAG !INF SOCK=0 ILVL<26]: %NAME%{%NAME%%WHITE%1-3, }%CONTINUE%
